  "description": "Custom or ‘off the peg’ geo and wheel size options all with tyre clearance for 2.4” tyres | Internal or external downtube cable routing, updated and super slick yoke and dropout design from the mighty Hulsroy\n\nA big heap of frame from a small bike workshop in East London, handmade to order for you by folks who know their stuff.\n\n2.4″ | Hulsroy yoke & dropouts | handmade to order\n\nThe OG PLUS is a frame to take advantage of the mullet, mix and match, mountain bike drive chain and road bike shifter component options that make a proper monster cross machine possible. It’s a gravalicious shred sled to get you out of bed and a 100% Bona fide rad about responsive dirt drop MTB force of cycling nature…\n\nOn this page please find deets, specs, build inspo and ordering options of our latest iteration of this majestic machine. We make our OG Plus frames in small batches with all of the yoke and dropout parts 3d printed to order, per batch, per frame.\n\nCustom sizing and geo available at no extra cost. WHATS THAT YOU SAY! It is what we do best and so we are sticking to it.\n\nSo! Check further down when the next batch is pencilled in for if you’re in the meerkat for a mega whippy, loose cannon, crazy horse of a monster cross bike then don’t delay! Drop us an email or get your order in below and start readying the stable.\n\nCustom size and geo, if required, at no extra cost. Just upload your fit data when paying your deposit.\n\nOptional internal DT routing at no extra cost.\n\n44mm ID straight headtube for tapered steerer or ENVE InRoute system.\n\n@Hulsroy OGPlus stainless 3d printed yoke for 2.4″ clearance with 40t chainring.\n\n@Hulsroy designed modular stainless 3d printed C40 style or hooded UDH dropout options.",
